{
  "name": "TurboDocx E-Signature: send contracts from Excel with a Slack approval",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "56e6cd6c-9aad-495e-ab60-686b8361e83b",
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        -608,
        -320
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "width": 480,
        "height": 896,
        "content": "## TurboDocx E-Signature: send contracts from Excel with a Slack approval\n\n### How it works\n\nThis workflow polls an Excel contract tracker every 15 minutes, loops through contracts ready to send, generates agreements in TurboDocx, and requests Slack approval before sending them for e-signature. Approved contracts are sent for signature, marked as sent in Excel, and announced in Slack, while rejected contracts are marked accordingly and the loop continues. A separate TurboDocx signing trigger downloads completed documents, files them in SharePoint, updates Excel, and posts a signed notification to Slack.\n\n### Setup steps\n\n- Connect Microsoft Excel credentials and configure the workbook, worksheet/table, and filters that identify contracts ready to send.\n- Connect TurboDocx credentials, select the agreement template, configure PDF download and e-signature sending settings, and enable the ContractSigned trigger/webhook.\n- Connect Slack credentials and configure the approval message/channel plus the sent and signed notification channels.\n- Connect Microsoft SharePoint credentials and choose the destination site, library, and folder for signed PDFs.\n- Verify the Excel update nodes write the expected statuses, such as sent, rejected, and signed, back to the correct rows.\n\n### Customization\n\nAdjust the schedule interval, approval rules, Slack message text, Excel status values, TurboDocx template fields, and SharePoint filing path to match your contract process."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "5bfd1b9d-210b-4fa6-86a6-3041408631dc",
      "name": "Sticky Note1",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        -48,
        -160
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 640,
        "height": 320,
        "content": "## Poll Excel contracts\n\nStarts the workflow on a 15-minute schedule, retrieves contracts ready to send from Excel, and feeds them one by one into the processing loop."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "01d6ecee-fb90-4e10-ac0f-9307f42f2720",
      "name": "Sticky Note2",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        640,
        -176
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 848,
        "height": 304,
        "content": "## Generate and approve agreement\n\nCreates the agreement in TurboDocx, asks for Slack approval, evaluates the approval response, and prepares the approved agreement PDF within the same approval cluster."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "bbbd8060-328b-4eb9-ab04-8bb74ea4300a",
      "name": "Sticky Note3",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        1520,
        -320
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 640,
        "height": 320,
        "content": "## Send approved contract\n\nSends the approved agreement for e-signature, updates the contract row in Excel as sent, and posts a sent confirmation to Slack before returning to the loop."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "53eca8f4-b262-4295-b1b3-b31916c87e31",
      "name": "Sticky Note4",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        1520,
        32
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 240,
        "height": 416,
        "content": "## Handle rejected contract\n\nMarks contracts rejected in Excel when the Slack approval decision is negative, then returns to the batch loop for the next contract."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "4ff11297-90ac-4a25-b4a0-89417d973a8d",
      "name": "Sticky Note5",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        -48,
        304
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 432,
        "height": 320,
        "content": "## Receive signed contract\n\nStarts the post-signature path when TurboDocx reports a contract was signed, then downloads the completed signed PDF."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "13c79df3-8c7e-4832-8156-b2ec6a44b066",
      "name": "Sticky Note6",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        416,
        320
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 640,
        "height": 304,
        "content": "## Archive signed document\n\nStores the signed PDF in SharePoint, marks the matching Excel record as signed, and posts a signed notification to Slack."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "n001",
      "name": "When Every 15 Minutes",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "minutes",
              "minutesInterval": 15
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "credentials": {},
      "typeVersion": 1.2
    },
    {
      "id": "n002",
      "name": "Fetch Contracts from Excel",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.microsoftExcel",
      "position": [
        220,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "table": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "id",
          "value": "YOUR_EXCEL_TABLE_ID"
        },
        "filters": {
          "values": [
            {
              "lookupValue": "Ready to send",
              "lookupColumn": "Status"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {},
        "resource": "table",
        "workbook": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "id",
          "value": "YOUR_EXCEL_WORKBOOK_ID"
        },
        "operation": "getRows",
        "returnAll": true,
        "worksheet": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "id",
          "value": "YOUR_EXCEL_WORKSHEET_ID"
        }
      },
      "credentials": {},
      "typeVersion": 2.2
    },
    {
      "id": "n003",
      "name": "Loop Over Contracts",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.splitInBatches",
      "position": [
        440,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "options": {}
      },
      "credentials": {},
      "typeVersion": 3
    },
    {
      "id": "n004",
      "name": "Generate Agreement Docx",
      "type": "@turbodocx/n8n-nodes-turbodocx.turboDocx",
      "position": [
        688,
        -32
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "name": "=Agreement - {{ $json['Client Name'] }}",
        "resource": "deliverable",
        "operation": "generate",
        "variables": "={{ JSON.stringify([\n  { placeholder: '{clientName}', text: $json['Client Name'], mimeType: 'text' },\n  { placeholder: '{company}',    text: $json['Company'],     mimeType: 'text' },\n  { placeholder: '{amount}',     text: String($json['Amount']), mimeType: 'text' },\n  { placeholder: '{client_sig}',  text: '{client_sig}',  mimeType: 'text' },\n  { placeholder: '{client_date}', text: '{client_date}', mimeType: 'text' }\n]) }}",
        "templateId": "YOUR_TURBODOCX_TEMPLATE_ID"
      },
      "credentials": {},
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "n005",
      "name": "Convert Agreement to PDF",
      "type": "@turbodocx/n8n-nodes-turbodocx.turboDocx",
      "position": [
        912,
        -32
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "deliverable",
        "operation": "downloadPdf",
        "deliverableId": "={{ $('Generate Agreement Docx').item.json.id }}"
      },
      "credentials": {},
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "n006",
      "name": "Request Slack Approval",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.slack",
      "position": [
        1136,
        -32
      ],
      "webhookId": "a1b2c3d4-slack-appr-0000-000000000001",
      "parameters": {
        "select": "channel",
        "message": "=*Send this contract for signature?*\n\n{{ $('Loop Over Contracts').item.json['Client Name'] }} — {{ $('Loop Over Contracts').item.json['Company'] }} — ${{ $('Loop Over Contracts').item.json['Amount'] }}",
        "options": {},
        "resource": "message",
        "channelId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "id",
          "value": "YOUR_SLACK_CHANNEL_ID"
        },
        "operation": "sendAndWait",
        "responseType": "approval",
        "approvalOptions": {
          "values": {
            "approvalType": "double",
            "approveLabel": "Approve & send",
            "disapproveLabel": "Reject"
          }
        }
      },
      "typeVersion": 2.3
    },
    {
      "id": "n007",
      "name": "If Approved in Slack",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "position": [
        1360,
        -32
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "options": {},
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "version": 2,
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "typeValidation": "loose"
          },
          "combinator": "and",
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "c",
              "operator": {
                "type": "boolean",
                "operation": "true",
                "singleValue": true
              },
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.data.approved }}",
              "rightValue": ""
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "credentials": {},
      "typeVersion": 2.2
    },
    {
      "id": "n008",
      "name": "Send Agreement for E-Signature",
      "type": "@turbodocx/n8n-nodes-turbodocx.turboDocx",
      "position": [
        1568,
        -160
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "fields": "=[{\"recipientEmail\":\"{{ $('Loop Over Contracts').item.json['Email'] }}\",\"type\":\"signature\",\"template\":{\"anchor\":\"{client_sig}\",\"placement\":\"replace\"}},{\"recipientEmail\":\"{{ $('Loop Over Contracts').item.json['Email'] }}\",\"type\":\"date\",\"template\":{\"anchor\":\"{client_date}\",\"placement\":\"replace\"}}]",
        "pdfFile": "data",
        "resource": "turboSign",
        "operation": "prepareForSigning",
        "recipients": "=[{\"name\":\"{{ $('Loop Over Contracts').item.json['Client Name'] }}\",\"email\":\"{{ $('Loop Over Contracts').item.json['Email'] }}\",\"signingOrder\":1}]",
        "documentName": "=Agreement - {{ $('Loop Over Contracts').item.json['Client Name'] }}",
        "fileInputMethod": "upload"
      },
      "credentials": {},
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
